# Skyward Spider: a +1/+1 counter modifies it (CR 700.9, 122.1), so it has flying for good, as long as the counter stays. Bot1 casts
# the Spider and Honor (a +1/+1 counter on target creature) with Moxen on turn 1. On turn 3 the Spider attacks with flying, so Bot2's
# Runeclaw Bear (no flying or reach) may not block it (CR 702.9b) and the 3/3 Spider deals 3.

